<title>SYRIA: Syria says sells 18,000 T wheat to Cargill.</title>
<headline>Syria says sells 18,000 T wheat to Cargill.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) on Thursday confirmed the sale of 18,000 tonnes of hard amber durum wheat to Cargill International at $195.5 per tonnes fob, a GECPT official said.</p>
<p>He told Reuters the wheat from the 1996 crop would be ready for shipment in May.</p>
</text>
